<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT-CSN maintained as neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSN maintained as neutral.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter said it was maintaining its neutral rating rating on Brazilian steelmaker Cia Siderurgica Nacional (CSN) but reducing its earnings estimates for the firm.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Hillary Kircher and Clicia Morales said in a report they were reducing their earnings estimates to reflect &quot;the effects of CSN's acquisition of 8.5 percent of Cia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD).&quot;</p>
</text>
